摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Hold-to-talk voice input for the DeepSeek Harness web composer: hold the mouse on the input box, speak, release to insert the text into the draft. Local SenseVoice ASR via sherpa-onnx: no API key, offline, audio never leaves the machine. | DSH 长按说话语音输入插件:输入框上按住鼠标说话,浮层边说边出字,松手把文字写","id":"gh:1365971776","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-hold-to-talk","slug":"wangzhanchao883/dsh-hold-to-talk","topics":["asr","audio","deepseek-harness","dictation","dsh","dsh-plugin","hold-to-talk","local-first","nodejs","offline","plugin","privacy","push-to-talk","sensevoice","sherpa-onnx","speech-to-text","voice","voice-input","wechat","wechat-desktop"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Hold-to-talk voice input for the DeepSeek Harness web composer: hold the mouse on the input box, spe"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ak, release to insert the text into the draft. Local SenseVoice ASR via sherpa-onnx: no API key, off"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"line, audio never leaves the machine. | DSH 长按说话语音输入插件:输入框上按住鼠标说话,浮层边说边出字,松手把文字写"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-hold-to-talk"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Hold-to-talk voice input for the DeepSeek Harness Web composer** — the WeChat-desktop gesture: hol"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"d the mouse on the input box, speak, see the running transcript float above it, release to drop the "},{"id":"p3s3","text":"text into the draft. Recognition runs **locally** (SenseVoice via sherpa-onnx): no API key, offline,"},{"id":"p3s4","text":" audio never leaves the machine."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**DSH Web 输入框的\"长按说话\"语音输入** —— 微信电脑版同款操作：在输入框上按住鼠标说话，浮层里边说边出字，松手把文字写进输入框，上滑取消。识别全部在**本机**跑（SenseVoice"},{"id":"p4s2","text":" + sherpa-onnx），免密钥、离线、音频不出本机。"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"English · 中文说明"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"### What it does"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- A long press on the composer starts dictation; releasing inserts the transcript into the draft; sl"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"iding up cancels; `Esc` cancels; a 60-second hold auto-finishes.\n- While you speak, an overlay above"},{"id":"p8s3","text":" the composer shows a live transcript, a level meter and the elapsed time.\n- The live transcript is "},{"id":"p8s4","text":"a **preview only** — it is never written into the draft. Only the release-time result (decoded from "},{"id":"p8s5","text":"the full audio) is inserted, so recognition jitter cannot corrupt what you are editing.\n- Recognitio"},{"id":"p8s6","text":"n is local: SenseVoice (int8) through sherpa-onnx, decoded in a worker thread. No API key, no cloud "},{"id":"p8s7","text":"call, no telemetry.\n- Normal editing is untouched: a quick click still places the caret, dragging st"},{"id":"p8s8","text":"ill selects text, and holding without reaching the threshold does nothing."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"### Requirements"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness running the **web** profile (`dsh web`).\n- Node.js `>=22.19` or `>=24` on the mac"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"hine running DSH.\n- A Chromium-based browser (Chrome / Edge) with microphone access. The DSH web UI\n"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"is served over `http://127.0.0.1`, which is a secure context, so `getUserMedia`\nis allowed.\n- ~230 M"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"B of disk for the model, downloaded once on first use."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### How it works"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Engineering decisions worth knowing:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- **Decoding runs in a worker thread.** sherpa-onnx decoding is synchronous and\nblocks for 0.6–3.3 s"},{"id":"p14s2","text":" per 6–22 s of audio; on the main thread it would stall the\nhost event loop and the page's streaming"},{"id":"p14s3","text":" output with it.\n- **Native first, WASM fallback.** `sherpa-onnx-node` (native, multi-threaded) is\n~"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"2.5× faster than `sherpa-onnx` (WASM, single-threaded) — see the table below.\nWASM lives in `optiona"},{"id":"p14s5","text":"lDependencies`; the worker falls back automatically.\n- **Absolute model paths only.** The WASM build"},{"id":"p14s6","text":" uses NODERAWFS; a relative path\nlands in emscripten's virtual CWD and is not found.\n- **The `AudioC"},{"id":"p14s7","text":"ontext` is created inside the `mousedown` gesture.** Creating it\n400 ms later gets it suspended by a"},{"id":"p14s8","text":"utoplay policy and no audio flows. The\ncapture node feeds a zero-gain sink before `destination` so i"},{"id":"p14s9","text":"t is pulled\nwithout being audible (otherwise: feedback howl).\n- **Resampling always restarts from sa"},{"id":"p14s10","text":"mple 0**, so successive increments tile the\nstream exactly; resampling only the tail would drift.\n- "},{"id":"p14s11","text":"**Previews wait for 2 seconds of audio.** A non-streaming model fed too little\nhallucinates (1.2 s p"},{"id":"p14s12","text":"roduced \"哈。\", 0.5 s produced \"Yeah.\").\n- **Late previews are dropped by epoch**, so a preview arrivi"},{"id":"p14s13","text":"ng after release can\nnever overwrite the final transcript.\n- **Gesture ownership is decided by DOM c"},{"id":"p14s14","text":"ontainment, never by visibility.** The\noverlay is hidden while idle; dispatching by `offsetParent`/`"},{"id":"p14s15","text":"getClientRects()`\nmade long-press die permanently after the first successful dictation (v0.1.0).\n- *"},{"id":"p14s16","text":"*The overlay anchor is always rendered** (zero-size, out of flow) so the\nownership anchor never disa"},{"id":"p14s17","text":"ppears, and a module token makes the previous\nmodule's document listeners inert after a hot reload."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"### Limitations"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"- SenseVoice is **not** a streaming model. \"Live\" is a re-decode of the tail\nwindow every 1.5 s, so "},{"id":"p16s2","text":"the preview trails speech by roughly 1.5–2 s; the final\nresult (on release) always uses the complete"},{"id":"p16s3","text":" audio.\n- Long dictation takes a moment to finish: ~3 s for 20 s of speech, ~9 s at the\n60 s cap.\n- "},{"id":"p16s4","text":"**Desktop mouse only.** Touch long-press is deliberately not implemented — it\ncollides with text sel"},{"id":"p16s5","text":"ection and the context menu on mobile.\n- The model download is 228 MB on first use."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### Security"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"- **Audio never leaves the machine.** It travels only over loopback HTTP to the\nplugin's own route a"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"nd is decoded by a local process. No third-party service is\ncontacted during recognition.\n- **No cre"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"dentials.** The plugin reads and stores no API key or token.\n- **Routes refuse cross-site requests**"},{"id":"p18s4","text":" (`sec-fetch-site`), so a random web page\ncannot post audio at the local server.\n- **The microphone "},{"id":"p18s5","text":"is opened only while you hold**; the stream's tracks are\nstopped on release, and no other page or pr"},{"id":"p18s6","text":"ocess gets the audio.\n- The only network request the plugin makes by itself is the one-time model\ndo"},{"id":"p18s7","text":"wnload from the configured mirror (`hf-mirror.com` by default). No telemetry."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"### 环境要求"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness，运行 **web** profile（`dsh web`）。\n- 运行 DSH 的机器上 Node.js `>=22.19` 或 `>=24`。\n- Chromi"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"um 系浏览器（Chrome / Edge）并允许麦克风。DSH Web 走 `http://127.0.0.1`，属安全上下文，`getUserMedia` 可用。\n- 首次使用需要约 230MB "},{"id":"p20s3","text":"器（Chrome / Edge）并允许麦克风。DSH Web 走 `http://127.0.0.1`，属安全上下文，`getUserMedia` 可用。\n- 首次使用需要约 230MB 磁盘放模型。"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### 已知限制"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"- **不是流式模型**：SenseVoice 是非流式识别，\"实时\"是每 1.5 秒重解码尾部窗口做出来的预览，因此预览比说话滞后约 1.5~2 秒；定稿（松手）永远用完整音频，结果最准。\n- **"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"长语音定稿要等**：说 20 秒约等 3 秒。60 秒上限约 9 秒。\n- **仅桌面鼠标**：没有实现 touch 长按（移动端长按会与文本选择/上下文菜单冲突），故意留空。\n- **麦克风需要安全"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"上下文**：`http://127.0.0.1` 属安全上下文，可用；若通过局域网 IP 访问需 https。\n- 首次下载 228MB 模型；`~/.dsh` 所在盘需留出空间。"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
